            <ArticleTitle>Case report: Two severe cases of suicide attempts using nicotine containing e-cigarette liquid.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1480-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The use of electronic cigarettes and nicotine-containing liquids is getting more common, thus increasing the risk for intentional or unintentional nicotine poisoning. The results of ingestion of nicotine can be severe, even fatal. We describe two different cases of severe poisonings caused by nicotine-containing electronic cigarette liquids.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
